"""
i18n — Internationalization for MyStrow
Supported languages: 'en' (English), 'fr' (French), 'es' (Spanish),
'de' (German), 'pt' (Brazilian Portuguese), 'ja' (Japanese)
Language is stored in ~/.mystrow_lang  (one line: 'en', 'fr', 'es', 'de', 'pt' or 'ja')

Keys without an entry for the current language fall back to English in tr(),
so a partial translation is always safe to ship.
"""
